    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ev_t", "x": 36, "y": 602, "width": 780, "height": 83,
      "text": "you control the OS and need long-lived state   →  Virtual Machine\nyou have an image and a finite task            →  Container Instance\nyou have an image and idle periods             →  Container App\nyou have code and want slots without plumbing  →  App Service\n\n# every one of them is created by the same main.bicep in Lab 3.1",
      "originalText": "you control the OS and need long-lived state   →  Virtual Machine\nyou have an image and a finite task            →  Container Instance\nyou have an image and idle periods             →  Container App\nyou have code and want slots without plumbing  →  App Service\n\n# every one of them is created by the same main.bicep in Lab 3.1",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
